<gpx version="1.1" creator="haiku-routes" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
  <metadata>
    <name>Imulas dabas taka</name>
    <desc>Established marked river trail loop with gravel-road return and a spur to Lanksēdes Velnapēdas stone. Steep slopes and steps; the publisher reports giant hogweed beside the stone spur and dogs near a house. Published by Martins, Dabastakas.lv. Downloaded 2026-09-05. All source coordinates and recorded elevations preserved; activity timestamps and sensor readings omitted.</desc>
    <author>
      <name>Martins / Dabastakas.lv</name>
    </author>
    <link href="https://dabastakas.lv/marsruti/imulas-dabas-taka/" />
    <link href="https://dabastakas.lv/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Imulas_dabas_taka.gpx" />
  </metadata>
